WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.650
(calm Christmas music)

00:00:15.844 --> 00:00:18.393
- This looks fantastic, Mrs. Johnson.

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:20.237
- Yeah, it almost looks as good as Mom's.

00:00:20.237 --> 00:00:23.220
- Stephanie, Carroll worked
extremely hard on this.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:24.137
- Oh, this?

00:00:25.135 --> 00:00:28.597
I just threw together a simple recipe.

00:00:28.597 --> 00:00:29.430
(smoke detector sounds)

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:30.604
- Oh! (bleep)

00:00:30.604 --> 00:00:31.804
Oh Holy! (bleep)

00:00:31.804 --> 00:00:32.637
Ah!

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:35.374
(calm Christmas music)

00:00:35.374 --> 00:00:37.210
- This is almost perfect.

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:38.884
If only Kyle could have made it home

00:00:38.884 --> 00:00:40.600
for Christmas this year.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.267
(knocking)

00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:44.477
(door creaks)

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:45.751
- Merry Christmas, Dad.

00:00:45.751 --> 00:00:48.323
- Kyle, what a Christmas miracle!

00:00:48.323 --> 00:00:49.766
- Anything for you, Dad.

00:00:49.766 --> 00:00:50.806
(chuckles)

00:00:50.806 --> 00:00:52.282
- Can we go a different
route or something?

00:00:52.282 --> 00:00:53.638
Why are you even going down this street?

00:00:53.638 --> 00:00:54.970
This street is terrible
at this time of day.

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:55.928
Can you double-time it?

00:00:55.928 --> 00:00:57.152
Can we just get a little faster, man?

00:00:57.152 --> 00:00:58.283
I'm kind of late for a flight right now.

00:00:58.283 --> 00:01:00.346
Literally 15 minutes, I'm stressing out!

00:01:00.346 --> 00:01:01.955
Have you ever tried to
check through security

00:01:01.955 --> 00:01:02.788
during the holidays?!

00:01:02.788 --> 00:01:03.621
(cars honking)

00:01:03.621 --> 00:01:04.509
This is freakin' nuts!

00:01:04.509 --> 00:01:05.895
Can, you turn up the AC?

00:01:05.895 --> 00:01:07.356
(calm Christmas music)

00:01:07.356 --> 00:01:10.523
(silverware clanking)

00:01:12.097 --> 00:01:13.499
(flashback)

00:01:13.499 --> 00:01:15.698
- Okay remember, we can't
bring up the Asian thing.

00:01:15.698 --> 00:01:16.656
- What Asian thing?

00:01:16.656 --> 00:01:17.489
- Shhh!

00:01:17.489 --> 00:01:19.458
- Can't I say "Asian" in my own home?

00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:23.208
So James, I had some
Thai food the other day.

00:01:24.085 --> 00:01:26.035
It was to Thai for.

00:01:26.035 --> 00:01:28.891
- Oh! (laughter)

00:01:28.891 --> 00:01:29.724
Oh, honey.

00:01:29.724 --> 00:01:31.682
(Carroll wheezes)

00:01:31.682 --> 00:01:33.328
(flashback)

00:01:33.328 --> 00:01:35.600
- My dad, he's not a racist,

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:38.354
but he might tell a bad joke or two.

00:01:38.354 --> 00:01:39.187
- Wait, what?

00:01:39.187 --> 00:01:40.459
- Don't worry about it, just ignore him.

00:01:40.459 --> 00:01:41.292
Dad!

00:01:41.292 --> 00:01:42.156
Daddy!

00:01:42.156 --> 00:01:43.955
(flashforward)

00:01:43.955 --> 00:01:44.788
- I'm Chinese.

00:01:44.788 --> 00:01:46.534
(sighs)

00:01:46.534 --> 00:01:48.701
But I do love Thai food.

00:01:48.701 --> 00:01:50.762
- Yeah, and we like Chinese food too.

00:01:50.762 --> 00:01:51.753
- Oh yes, yes!

00:01:51.753 --> 00:01:52.586
- Yeah.

00:01:52.586 --> 00:01:53.828
- Maybe you could cook some for us.

00:01:53.828 --> 00:01:55.586
- Okay Carroll, we're done.

00:01:55.586 --> 00:01:56.657
- Don't they all cook?

00:01:56.657 --> 00:01:57.949
- I'm sure Chinese people cook.

00:01:57.949 --> 00:01:58.782
- [Carroll] He said he's Chinese

00:01:58.782 --> 00:01:59.615
do you think he doesn't know...

00:01:59.615 --> 00:02:00.448
- I don't know much about him,

00:02:00.448 --> 00:02:01.811
I just met him also, so.

00:02:01.811 --> 00:02:04.555
- Alrighty then, we normally
do Christmas presents

00:02:04.555 --> 00:02:07.271
after dinner, but I
just can't help myself.

00:02:07.271 --> 00:02:09.386
(calm Christmas music)

00:02:09.386 --> 00:02:10.746
- Thank you

00:02:10.746 --> 00:02:12.858
- Woah, the new G Phone 6-7s, Dad!

00:02:12.858 --> 00:02:13.764
- Oh my gosh!

00:02:13.764 --> 00:02:15.128
Thank you so much, Daddy!

00:02:15.128 --> 00:02:16.048
- How'd you get this?

00:02:16.048 --> 00:02:17.048
They're sold out everywhere.

00:02:17.048 --> 00:02:19.423
- A magician never reveals his secrets.

00:02:19.423 --> 00:02:20.424
(flashback)

00:02:20.424 --> 00:02:21.263
(baby wailing)

00:02:21.263 --> 00:02:22.595
- [Intercom] Attention shoppers...

00:02:22.595 --> 00:02:23.636
(alarm sounding)

00:02:23.636 --> 00:02:25.335
(glass breaking)

00:02:25.335 --> 00:02:26.168
- Ah!

00:02:26.168 --> 00:02:27.368
(automatic rifle firing)

00:02:27.368 --> 00:02:28.888
- I saw it first.

00:02:28.888 --> 00:02:31.561
- Well, anything for my kids. (chuckles)

00:02:31.561 --> 00:02:32.644
- Ho, ho, ho!

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:37.497
(drunken sigh) It's Santa, everybody!

00:02:37.497 --> 00:02:42.077
It's not your brother,
the big disappointment,

00:02:42.077 --> 00:02:43.558
Greg!

00:02:43.558 --> 00:02:44.999
(flashback)

00:02:44.999 --> 00:02:48.047
- Johnny, look I know this has been

00:02:48.047 --> 00:02:51.098
a hard year for you with
the divorce and everything.

00:02:51.098 --> 00:02:55.265
But I think for Christmas,
we're just gonna do our family.

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:57.630
I hope you understand.

00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:58.463
- Oh yeah,

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:02.398
Merry Christmas.
(hangs up)

00:03:02.398 --> 00:03:04.065
Nobody loves Johnny.

00:03:05.539 --> 00:03:07.706
(inhales)

00:03:08.799 --> 00:03:10.590
But everyone loves Santa!

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.809
(flashforward)

00:03:11.809 --> 00:03:14.034
I'm just sayin' we should
give Trump a chance!

00:03:14.034 --> 00:03:14.940
(silverware crashes)

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:15.773
(claps)

00:03:15.773 --> 00:03:17.091
- Okay, I think it's time

00:03:17.091 --> 00:03:19.465
to take our family Christmas picture.

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:20.322
- Great idea!
- Yeah.

00:03:20.322 --> 00:03:21.638
- Yeah!

00:03:21.638 --> 00:03:23.114
(sigh)

00:03:23.114 --> 00:03:24.656
- The family's all here.

00:03:24.656 --> 00:03:25.731
- James, get in the picture.

00:03:25.731 --> 00:03:27.906
- No, no I don't think James
should be in the picture.

00:03:27.906 --> 00:03:29.137
- Daddy, that's not fair!

00:03:29.137 --> 00:03:29.970
- It is fair!

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:31.407
This is a family picture.

00:03:31.407 --> 00:03:33.027
James is not family!

00:03:33.027 --> 00:03:34.672
- Oh my God that's so rude!

00:03:34.672 --> 00:03:37.007
- Well I'm not family yet,

00:03:37.007 --> 00:03:40.566
but I was hoping to change that tonight.

00:03:40.566 --> 00:03:41.596
- Oh God.

00:03:41.596 --> 00:03:44.050
- Steph, will you marry me?

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:44.883
- Yes!

00:03:44.883 --> 00:03:45.865
- Absolutely not!

00:03:45.865 --> 00:03:47.267
- Daddy!
- Greg.

00:03:47.267 --> 00:03:48.167
What do you think you're doing?

00:03:48.167 --> 00:03:49.414
- [Greg] You hardly know him!

00:03:49.414 --> 00:03:51.264
- You barely knew Carroll
when you married her!

00:03:51.264 --> 00:03:52.524
(everyone shouting)

00:03:52.524 --> 00:03:56.693
- It's not different, she
was Mom's funeral director!

00:03:56.693 --> 00:03:58.193
- One, two, three.

00:03:59.659 --> 00:04:00.506
(camera snaps)

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:03.839
(happy Christmas music)

00:04:12.025 --> 00:04:13.122
(whooshes)

00:04:13.122 --> 00:04:14.749
(creaks)

00:04:14.749 --> 00:04:18.166
(electronic dance music)

